            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Companion 0.1.119</h2><ul><li>Fixes Sparkle update eligibility by enforcing strictly increasing Companion build numbers.</li><li>Adds appcast verification so the published update feed matches the notarized DMG bundle version and Sparkle signature.</li><li>Converts Powerhouse warmup into a nonblocking background job with live progress, cancel, retry, and UI recovery controls.</li><li>Keeps QR pairing, bridge readiness, and route start independent from Powerhouse warm/prewarm completion.</li></ul>
]]></description>
